i) The appeal is allowed-in-part;
 ii) The judgment and award dated 09.07.2014 passed by II Additional Senior Civil Judge and Additional MACT-V, Chitradurga in MVC No.632/2013, is modified;
iii) The claimant is entitled for total compensation of `2,38,463/- as against `1,33,500/- awarded by the tribunal;
Rangaswamy vs Naganna @ Nagaraja on 18 January, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/41419509/

